      "cooked": "<p>Mint. &nbsp;Not too bad. &nbsp;Both EPEs and Technological Singularities came out while the environment was being annoying. &nbsp;But I never saw the Fletchettes, which would have been nasty. &nbsp;Could have wrapped up the round before I did, but I forgot about the \"kill all devices\" rule.</p>",
