      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/d07c76/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2017-02-28T08:21:02.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Mint. &nbsp;Interesting end. &nbsp;I killed off Omnitron with a 27 point Wrathful Retribution, but he still had a full life EPE out. &nbsp;Interestingly, Tempest ended the game immediately by sending the EPE back on top of Omnitron's deck with Into the Stratosphere. &nbsp;I guess they just all have to be removed from play, not destroyed.</p>",
