      "id": 190403,
      "name": "KateWalker",
      "username": "TakeWalker",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
      "created_at": "2017-02-28T13:48:36.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Easy mint. I was a little concerned about only having three heroes, but they have such good synergy, it didn't matter the other two Wardens weren't there.</p><p>There were a number of turns of \"the environment just did something bad, so of <em>course</em> Omnitron is doing something bad, too\", but other than Fanatic getting into single-digit HP (fixed with a quick pick-me-up from Haka), nothing too bad really came of it. I saw Flechettes on the final turn, which was fine, because Omnitron was down to low single-digits at that point and couldn't have survived anyway. I've never ended a game with Into the Stratosphere before!</p>",
      "post_number": 5,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:16:44.209Z",
