      "id": 190405,
      "name": "Reverend Pete",
      "username": "Reverend_Pete",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/278dde/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2017-02-28T14:59:17.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Mint.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Was getting near the end, Omnitron at 2HP when the second EPE came out, and I went \"Ugh, even if I take out Omnitron I can't win until the EPE goes away. I'm probably going to have to go through another round.&nbsp;How annoying.\"</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>But then, I realized the only card in Tempest's hand was Into the Stratosphere. With one card play, Tempest said bye-bye to the EPE and destroyed Omnitron.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I didn't have to deal with the&nbsp;annoyance after all!</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Fanatic at 3HP, Tempest at 7HP and Haka at 12HP.</p>",
      "post_number": 7,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:16:44.356Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
