      "created_at": "2017-02-28T16:06:57.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Easy mint with a remarkably effective trio, even if I had to use a Ball Lightning to get rid of an entirely unintentional End of Days (I REALLY wish PW Fanatic's power gave you the option to either play or trash the revealed card).</p><p>Everyone finished in style with Fanatic at 21, Tempest at 26 and Haka at 34</p>",
